From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wangzlei <66336933+wangzlei@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:57:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] red-attrs: peer.service.name on client spans and HTTP
 client RED metrics

Emit the downstream's TCP-option-propagated service.name as peer.service.name
(renamed from tcp.peer.service.name) on client spans, and add it as a default
attribute of the http client RED metric group (http.client.request.duration).

Source: 5da1826a, f5027fd8.
Adot-Obi-Patch: 03-peer-service-name-red-attrs
---
 pkg/appolly/app/request/span_getters.go | 7 +++++++
 pkg/export/attributes/attr_defs.go      | 5 +++--
 pkg/export/attributes/names/attrs.go    | 5 +++++
 pkg/export/otel/tracesgen/tracesgen.go  | 8 +++-----
 4 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/pkg/appolly/app/request/span_getters.go b/pkg/appolly/app/request/span_getters.go
